&oh=00_AQABTJFfpiosUtpZIHVuf5p8p5032saBS-PlUJDIiwn3lg&oe=6A564A15"}, {"file_name": "Interview_01.png", "id": "558098475502894", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982460_558098478836227_2195642163881727498_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tv7Lur9L2kYQ7kNvwGCx07n&_nc_oc=Adow-mwDXf7xt8BPs4Ute-lOU9ppYTWZN0cJ3H_HWEoSR47zKYw4lBm-Cj6WV-sscY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBbZDUfLOljcVa1-t1k1EPD8ordiK_j4uhyUTk1kGnRWg&oe=6A562E4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JOb INterview Simulator (4).png", "id": "371985591479423", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035469_371985598146089_1320847157226308449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aNjMBu5vRfUQ7kNvwHtypg0&_nc_oc=AdrMb6VIVkNo_c9leZ4NYgEADw0TKbbJHbPgDGRto8GATl3WaFydbFhx3tZ1_Snq5wU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBCmH2ckSwuKv_4z5KjfFNz38fJ_CVeF_VkUa0u7E82yg&oe=6A562DD0"}, "display_name": "Job Interview Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Proficient job interviewing craft is vital to attain the careers of our dreams. Unfortunately, it's difficult to practice this skill in a realistic way.\n\nThat's why we built the Job Interview Simulator. Simulate the entire interviewing process; from emailing HR before the interview, picking an outfit, arriving on time, catching the elevator, greeting the receptionist, and acing the interview. \n\nFeel the situational pressure of a Job Interview in an immersive virtual environent, and refine your interviewing craft with automated feedback. \n", "short_description": "Simulate the experience of a Job Interview in Virtual Reality. Practice and hone your interviewing craft in a safe setting, so you can ace your next job interview!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.workwindow.com.au/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.workwindow.co